@model Accountingsystem.ViewModel.AdditionalOrderDetailVM


@using (Html.BeginForm("AddNewCustomerPartial", "Cachier", FormMethod.Post, new { @class = "form-horizontal", role = "form", enctype = "multipart/form-data" }))
{
    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
    @Html.ValidationSummary(true, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
    @Html.HiddenFor(model=> model.OrderDetailId)
    <div class="col-xl-12 col-lg-12 col-md-12 layout-spacing">
        <form>
            <div class="">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-11 mx-auto">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-12">
                                <div class="form-group  text-center">
                                    @Html.Label(Accountingsystem.Resources.CachierCreate.SelectAdditionalDetail)
                                    <div class="input-group">
                                        @Html.DropDownListFor(model => model.SelectedAdditionalDetail, Model.AdditionalDetailList, Accountingsystem.Resources.CachierCreate.SelectAdditionalDetail, htmlAttributes: new { @class = "form-control mb-4 Dropdownlist-select" })

                                    </div>
                                    @Html.ValidationMessageFor(model => model.SelectedAdditionalDetail, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-12">
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <a href='javascript:;' onclick='addAdditionalOrderDetail();' class="btn btn-block btn-outline-primary mb-lg-0">@Accountingsystem.Resources.CachierCreate.AddAdditionalDetailToItem  <div id="additionalDetailSpinner" style="display:none;" class="spinner-border text-dark mr-2 align-self-center loader-sm"></div></a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>
    <script>
        $(document).ready(function () {
            $("#additionalDetailSpinner").hide();
            $("#SelectedAdditionalDetail").chosen();
            $("#SelectedAdditionalDetail_chosen").addClass("form-control Dropdownlist-select");
        });

    </script>
    <script>
      
        $('#SelectedAdditionalDetail').on('change', function () {
            $("#SelectedAdditionalDetail_chosen").removeClass("addRequiredFieldToInput");
            $('#SelectedAdditionalDetail_chosen span').css('background', '#ffffff');
            $('#SelectedAdditionalDetail_chosen b').css('background', '#ffffff');
        });

    </script>
    <script>
        function addAdditionalOrderDetail() {
        var orderDetailId = @Model.OrderDetailId;
            var selectedAdditionalDetailId = $("#SelectedAdditionalDetail").val();
        if (SelectedAdditionalDetail == "" || SelectedAdditionalDetail == null || SelectedAdditionalDetail < 1) {

            if (SelectedAdditionalDetail < 1) {
                Snackbar.show({
                    text: "@Accountingsystem.Resources.CustomerCreate.SliceIsRequiredMessage",
                    pos: 'top-center'
                });
                $("#SelectedAdditionalDetail").addClass("addRequiredFieldToInput");
                $("#SelectedAdditionalDetail_chosen").addClass("addRequiredFieldToInput");
                $('#SelectedAdditionalDetail_chosen span').css('background', 'red');
                $('#SelectedAdditionalDetail_chosen b').css('background', 'red');
                $('#SelectedAdditionalDetail_chosen').trigger('focus');
            }
          
        }
        else {
            $("#additionalDetailSpinner").show();
            $('#additionalDetailModal').modal('toggle');       

            var parameters = { 'selectedAdditionalDetailId': selectedAdditionalDetailId, 'orderDetailId': orderDetailId };
            var data = JSON.stringify(parameters);
        $.ajax(
         {
                url: "@Url.Action("AddNewAdditional", "Cachier")",
                data: data,
                contentType: 'application/json',
                dataType: 'json',
                type: 'POST',
                success: function (data) {
                    Snackbar.show({
                        text: "@Accountingsystem.Resources.CachierCreate.AdditionalDetailHasbeenAdded",
                        pos: 'top-center'
                    });
                    $("#additionalDetailSpinner").hide();

                    $("#allItemsOfInvoice").load('@(Url.Action("GetAllTempOrderDetails", "Cachier"))?orderId=' + data);

             },
                error: function () {

                    Snackbar.show({
                    text: "@Accountingsystem.Resources.CustomerCreate.ErrorMessage",
                        pos: 'top-center'
                    });
                    $("#additionalDetailSpinner").hide();
                }
         });
        }
    };
    </script>

}